    "summary": "The same two cases were opened on 2026-10-05 with the first-attempt adapters (tasks 9 and 10). Finalize was not run before the kernel's judgment window closed. CloseFirstAttempt (2026-10-09) finalized both issues as the registry had already determined them and settled the kernel side.",
